WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.260
SPEAKER 1: My grandparents
have low vision

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.390
and aren't as mobile.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.850
I wanted to build something that
could help them move around,

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:23.710
and then I met--

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:24.210
--Sara.

00:00:42.435 --> 00:00:44.310
SPEAKER 2: There's a
mailbox in front of you.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.653
Move right to walk around it.

00:00:46.653 --> 00:00:48.320
SPEAKER 1: We're in
separate continents.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.276
So we had to find a way
to collaborate remotely.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.890
I even learned a
little Portuguese.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.530
Our app uses computer
vision and a combination

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:13.300
of neural networks powered
by Google Cloud's AI.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.330
One network helps identify
the objects the camera sees.

00:01:21.413 --> 00:01:23.580
SPEAKER 2: There's a coffee
table blocking your path

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:26.080
to the door in front.

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.180
SPEAKER 1: We hope
that eventually anyone

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.870
can use the app for indoor
and outdoor navigation,

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:34.840
and even on public transport.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.270
SPEAKER 2: To take the red
line, turn left and then right.

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:45.940
SPEAKER 1: But it
doesn't take a computer

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:48.190
to see where that would take us.

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:51.540
[MUSIC PLAYING]

